{
    "title": "Spider Solitaire",
    "description": "Spider Solitaire pairs the relaxing gameplay you love with a clean design and a fresh, modern look. Experience all the fun and challenges of Spider with multiple suits available.\r\n\r\nIf you like classic and fun card games like Spades, Hearts and Rummy or other types of solitaire like Klondike Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, and FreeCell Solitaire, then Spider Solitaire is for you!\r\n\r\nPlaying Spider Solitaire is easy if you like playing cards. Place all the cards in each suit in stacks of descending order. Weave your way as a beginner through 1 suit games and move up in difficulty as you attempt to tackle 2 and 4 suit games and become a true Spider Solitaire master!\r\n\r\nSpider Solitaire challenges you to stack all cards of each suit in descending order to solve the puzzle. Try it now to earn points, climb the leaderboard and come out on top as the best Spider Solitaire master.\r\n\r\nGame Features:\r\n\r\nClassic Spider Solitaire:\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Classic, fun games of Patience, totally free on your phone\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Spider Solitaire games come in 1, 2, and 4 suit varieties\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Cards come alive with stunning animations, flawless graphics and classic interface\r\n\r\nDaily Challenge:\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Challenge yourself every day\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Record every achievement you made\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Stay Sharp and see every improvement\r\n\r\nUser Friendly Experience:\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Enjoy clean and pleasant visual design\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Simple Tap to Move to make your gameplay more easy\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Play Offline: Play random deals anywhere\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Supports left-handed play\r\n\r\nDownload the best Spider Solitaire available for your mobile device now! It's Free to play.",
